{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, hope you're doing okay. I wanted to chat about something that's been bothering me lately... I went for a check-up Monday and my doc said my weight's a serious health risk - if I don't make changes soon, it can get worse. I know I made jokes about it, but it's really hitting me. Been having a hard time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_12-9a95ba28c4fef3c532196fb2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:57:07.259050+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a95ba28c4fef3c532196fb2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a95ba28c4fef3c532196fb2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, tough news. Yeah, our health can really put a damper on things. I started lifting weights one year ago and it's been a journey. It was a struggle at first, but I'm seeing some gains. You interested in trying it out?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_12-be403550cf49124760ae3d99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:57:07.294002+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be403550cf49124760ae3d99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be403550cf49124760ae3d99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, I'm interested in getting into it. Any advice on how to get started? Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_12-351163fbb94d95fcebe367af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:57:07.309951+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "351163fbb94d95fcebe367af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "351163fbb94d95fcebe367af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
